# --- The Witcher 3 Remastered (5.00, 29 September 2026) ---------------------------------------
# What changed for mods (the modding guide "What does the remaster mean for modding?", linked from
# nexusmods.com/witcher3/mods/12945, and the Remastered changelog on GitHub):
#   - every text file (.ws, .xml, .csv, .w3strings) must be UTF-8; 4.x's were UTF-16
#   - collision.cache, soundspc.cache and SpeedTree .srt changed format: a mod's old ones won't work
